.TH ALIASES 7N UniSoft
.SH NAME
aliases \- aliases file for delivermail
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B /usr/lib/aliases
.SH DESCRIPTION
This file describes user 
.SM ID
aliases that will be used by
.BR /etc/delivermail .
It is formatted as a series of lines
of the form
.RS
name:addr1,addr2,...addrn
.RE
.PP
The
.I name\^
is the name to alias,
and the
.I addri\^
are the addresses to send the message to.
Lines beginning with white space
are continuation lines.
Lines beginning with `\|#\|'
are comments.
.PP
Aliasing occurs only on local names.
Loops cannot occur
since no message will be sent to any person
more than once.
.SH SEE ALSO
delivermail(8N).
.\"	@(#)aliases.7n	5.2 of 7/26/84
